OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, with
OL,5,Aauthor due to speak to BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is a risk of people being
OL,8,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism, an
OL,9,Fofficial review in England says
OL,11,FCases now appear to be outstripping the
OL,12,Fexpected number in the population for
OL,13,Fsome younger age groups following a
OL,14,Frise in diagnoses, experts say
OL,16,FThe review looked at people of all
OL,17,Fages, but particularly focused on young
OL,18,Fpeople and children who have the
OL,19,Fhighest rates of diagnoses
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
