OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, with
OL,5,Aauthor due to speak to BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt concludes that the rise in mental
OL,8,Fhealth problems seen among young people
OL,9,Fis real - and says there needs to be
OL,10,Fbetter support
OL,12,FMany young people "have a weight on
OL,13,Ftheir shoulders with regards to
OL,14,Finclusion" and feel "like a square peg
OL,15,Fin a round hole", a child
OL,16,Fpsychotherapist tells the BBC
OL,18,FTh report published today was
OL,19,Fcommissioned by former health secretary
OL,20,FWes Streeting after he said he believed
OL,21,Fthere was an "over-diagnosis" of mental
OL,22,Fhealth conditions
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
